{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28121","headline":"蜀中战後感事 · 雍陶","name":"蜀中战後感事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蜀道英灵地，山重水又回。\n文章四子盛，道路五丁开。\n词客题桥去，忠臣叱驭来。\n卧龙同骇浪，跃马比浮埃。\n已谓无妖土，那知有祸胎。\n蕃兵依𣾴柳，蛮斾指江梅\n战後悲逢血，烧余恨见灰。\n空留犀厌怪，无复酒除灾。\n岁积苌弘怨，春深杜宇哀。\n家贫移未得，愁上望乡台。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"雍陶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28121.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28121","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}